      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "# Getting Started with CloudScale DataStream API\n\nWelcome to CloudScale DataStream API! This guide will help you get up and running quickly with our powerful data streaming solutions.\n\n## Prerequisites\nBefore you start, ensure you have:\n- An active CloudScale account.\n- Required permissions to access data streams.\n- Familiarity with REST API concepts.\n\n## Setting Up Your Environment\n1. **Authentication**\n   - Obtain access tokens as per our [Authentication Guide](#).\n2. **Creating Data Streams**\n   - Use the Data Stream Management tool to design your pipeline.\n3. **Configuration & Deployment**\n   - Define your stream's parameters and deploy it using [CloudScale CLI](#).\n\n## Working with Data Streams\nExplore the features of CloudScale DataStream:\n\n- **Data Ingestion**\n  - Detailed explanation and example.\n- **Real-time Processing**\n  - Step-by-step guide with visual aids.\n- **Querying Data Streams**\n  - Learn how to write and run queries.\n\n## Troubleshooting\nCommon issues and their fixes:\n- **Connection Errors**\n  - Verify your network settings.\n- **Query Failures**\n  - Check your query syntax and logic.\n\n## Support & Feedback\n- **Help Center**",
      "source": "target",
